 "description": "CR 602.5b, 605.1a, 605.3b, 106.4: each Devotee's {1} mana ability adds the one colour of its three its controller picks, and 'Activate only once each turn' refuses a second activation the same turn but not the next one",
 "note": "Alice has three Devotees and four Plains. On each of her turns 1, 4 and 7 she pays {1} with a Plains for each Devotee in turn, picking its first, second then third printed colour, so the pool grows by exactly the picked colour; a second activation of each Devotee paid with the fourth, still untapped Plains is refused, leaving that Plains untapped and the pool unchanged. The ability returns on the next of her turns with a different colour.",
